msgstr "所选媒体未提供安全、永久的图片 URL。"

#: src/index.js:395
msgid "The media library could not be opened."
msgstr "无法打开媒体库。"

#: src/index.js:430
msgid "Markdown could not be saved."
msgstr "Markdown 无法保存。"

#: src/index.js:454
msgid "WordPress revisions are disabled for this post type. Markdown can still be saved, but historical recovery is limited."
msgstr "此文章类型已禁用 WordPress 修订版本。Markdown 仍可保存，但历史恢复能力有限。"

